  "content": "\n\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/cw/lolip_p\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/More content-000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=white\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Cz2sCWz5Wh\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865F2.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<h1>關於：</h1>\n<p><strong>嗨，我是 LoLip_p！我開發了這款光影，旨在營造緊張且詭異的氛圍，非常適合恐怖整合包。若你能將其納入你的專案中，我會感到非常榮幸。它包含 CRT 遮罩、各種影片故障效果、雜訊特效等。如果有任何效果不符合你的喜好，所有參數皆支援完全自訂，你可以輕鬆開啟或關閉設定。歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://patreon.com/lolip_p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 支持作者。</strong></p>\n<h3>截圖：</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sAZ9WsJP/images/957b7b8e34b8a77f17b347a499c08a2052941c35.jpeg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p>\n<h2>連結：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Cz2sCWz5Wh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">Discord</span></a>（討論、錯誤回報等）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@lolip_p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">YouTube</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fLoLip_p_Community\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Telegram</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>安裝光影</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>下載支援安裝光影的遊戲版本，例如 Optifine 或 Iris</li>\n<li>下載光影檔案</li>\n<li>將光影複製到 /.minecraft/shaderpacks 資料夾</li>\n<li>啟動 Minecraft，前往選項 --&gt; 影像設定 --&gt; 光影</li>\n<li>選擇 <strong>Cursed Fog</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>示範影片</h2>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\">嵌入已移除：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fzdIKteyJ0YI\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/zdIKteyJ0YI</a></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.neyhost.com%252f%253fref%253dLOLIP30\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b88f233b0b7819fa09603e3da40613cb199093f7_0.webp\" alt=\"NeyHost\"></a></p>",
